Helm and Kubernetes Networking
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Install and configure Helm on a Kubernetes cluster
Deploy applications using Helm charts with proper networking configuration
Configure Kubernetes Ingress controllers for external access
Set up service-to-service communication within Kubernetes
Create custom Helm charts with networking components
Implement cross-namespace networking policies
Troubleshoot common networking issues in Helm deployments
